    "body": "@felixsanz Seems like nested figures with a table would make sense for that image.\r\n```\r\n<figure>\r\n\t<img/>\r\n\t<figcaption>\r\n\t\t<figure>\r\n\t\t\t<figcaption/>\r\n\t\t\t<table/>\r\n\t\t</figure>\r\n\t\t<small/>\r\n\t</figcaption>\r\n</figure>\r\n```",
